</style>
<h2>Asobi 1.0 (build 988)</h2>
<ul>
<li><b>Attachment thumbnails from the room.</b> A file that reached you over a shared review showed a placeholder tile forever; the tile now draws the picture as soon as the bytes land.</li>
<li><b>Attachments stay in the room.</b> The host keeps its own copy and no longer removes the room's copy as it takes it, so a web seat that reloads or joins later still sees the file. When the room is full (500 MB) the host makes room by letting go of the oldest files it already holds.</li>
<li><b>Web:</b> reloading a review that held a note with an attachment stopped the page part-way through its notes (the count read 2 with one row drawn); the pasted image looked lost. Fixed.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
